	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_enemy_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もんばん『むだだと　おもうぜー▼
ボクと　いっしょに
ここに　いれば　いいのに……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>門番『無駄だと　思うぜー▼
ボクと　一緒に
ここに　いれば　いいのに……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
