		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]王子『なー　もう
いいかげん　ヒント　教えてよ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
